<title>AUSTRIA: Creditanstalt sees 1996 dividend rise.</title>
<headline>Creditanstalt sees 1996 dividend rise.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Creditanstalt chief executive Guido Schmidt-Chiari said on Thursday there was room for the bank to raise its 1996 dividend from last year's 10 schillings per share.</p>
<p>&quot;There is room for an increase,&quot; he told a news conference. -- Vienna newsroom -- +43-1 531-12250</p>
</text>
